  "body": "## What changed\n`crates/app/src/operation/params.rs` held one function, `OpParams::stamp_with`, of about 1780 lines. It is now split into child modules of `params`.\n- `params.rs` (360 lines) keeps the signature, the kind tag, and the Face, Contour, Pocket and Adaptive2D arms. Its match stays exhaustive. It sends every other kind to one method per family.\n- `params/mill2d.rs`, `mill3d.rs`, `multiaxis.rs`, `turning.rs`, `holes.rs`, `cutting.rs` (wire, sinker, plasma) hold those arms. Every arm moved verbatim.\n- `params/digest.rs` holds the shared writers (`w`, `wh`, `wh_opt`, `wp2`, `wt`, formerly closures) and the link trailer (`stamp_links`).\n- `params/size_tests.rs` pins the 400-line law for all these files.\n\nThe largest file now has 360 lines. The public path is unchanged (`OpParams::stamp_with`, `pub(super)`). `operation/mod.rs` is untouched.\n\n## Cause\nThe digest arms of every operation kind were added to one match over time.\n\n## Tests\n- New pin: `operation::params::size_tests::params_files_stay_under_the_line_law`. Red on unchanged code (\"params.rs has 1801 lines, the law is 400\"). Green after the split.\n- Mutation: old `params.rs` put back → the pin fails. Restored → it passes.\n- Byte identity: a temporary test (not committed) wrote the digest of every kind's seed params, with default links and two edited link sets (132 cases). The old and new outputs were identical. A script also checked that every line of the old match body and of the link trailer appears unchanged in the new files.\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`) green on 63beeab2: the app lib plus the 13 suites mapped to `app::operation::params`.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n- `#[test]` count in `crates/app/src`: 334 before, 335 after. The one added test is the pin.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\nNo permanent test pins the digest values, because `DefaultHasher` output can change between Rust releases. The identity check was a one-off.\n\n## Overlaps\n#1817 and #2037 edit the Pocket arm of `stamp_with`. This PR leaves that arm, and the arms around it, in `params.rs`. Those PRs touch the same file but different lines, so they should merge without a conflict. Whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nDecision record: `docs/decisions/1849-split-params.md`.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nChangelog: none (refactor, no behaviour change)\n\nFixes #1849\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
